  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/187/5ada0f572c9d4449ef5cdb44ac00f24a..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">うるるちゃんと久しぶりに遊んだよ^ー^</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">お互い一限から頑張って、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ご褒美だった‼️‼️</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">誰かと会うために頑張れるってとても</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">幸せなことですね、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとに楽しいので</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">お別れが辛すぎる</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">しょうもない事で爆笑しまくって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">めちゃめちゃ食べまくって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">最高の時間でしたね、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/187/dbb1461b175bdeeccff01863bde66643..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/187/d680d5cac0707d75e495e4f7a0809292..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">本当に、すき、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんかねーうるるちゃんって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私がキモイこと言った時に(いうな)</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">キモイって言ってくれるんだよねー</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">それがね、嬉しー！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">これはどえむとかじゃないでつ😵‍💫💦</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">愛があるって訳ですわよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">謎の出会いを遂げてから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">こんなに仲良くなれるなんて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">思わなかった～！本当に好き！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">うるるちゃんはいつも忙しいのに</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いっぱい頑張っててえらい～です</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">可愛いし可愛いし可愛いし</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">優しくて面白い</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">あと音楽の趣味が合う！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/187/14cd7871a74db5e143bb526fe429344d..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">Kissだよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">お泊まりもする約束した！たのしみ( ᵕᴗᵕ )✩⡱</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
